      "value": "<blockquote><p>Harness Shadow Power for Stealth and Subterfuge</p></blockquote><p>Warriors of Shadow practice stealth and subterfuge, drawing on the power of the Shadowfell. At home in darkness, they can wrap themselves in gloom to hide, leap from shadow to shadow, and take on a wraithlike form.</p><h3>Warrior of Shadow Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.cinwTb73gph32JKu]{Shadow Arts}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.FXY8Jwsub1zoaA1c]{Shadow Step}</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.xqEqPhGSXoRQP0vj]{Improved Shadow Step}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ViwFSPxI25u4KbBP]{Cloak of Shadows}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
